# RBAC (MVP)

Authorization is enforced in the **Service** layer.

Never trust the UI. Never trust the client. Repositories never authorize.

## Roles

| Role | Notes |
|------|--------|
| Admin | From player pool; may also play and vote |
| Player | Active member |

No other roles.

## Admin can

- Add / remove / suspend players
- Create / edit weekend matches and tournaments
- Confirm matches (triggers polls + notifications)
- Edit polls after freeze (match day − 1)
- Mark offline payments paid
- Manage team fund, expenses, contribution asks
- Confirm weekend settlement progress

## Player can

- Complete / edit own profile (editable fields only)
- Vote on availability + carpool polls (until freeze)
- View who opted in
- Pay weekend fees (UPI → UTR + screenshot)
- Receive notifications

## Route protection

- Unauthenticated → login
- Authenticated but not an active member → access denied
- Forbidden action → permission denied (service + UI)

## Service rules

Every mutating operation verifies:

1. Authenticated user
2. Active membership on Ranches Thunders
3. Role / permission for the action
4. Entity ownership (`team_id` / `match_id`)
